   463	|---|---|---|
   464	| nodal `(6,4)` | **OPEN** | Sole survivor `Delta=(6,4,3)`, `beta_1=15`, `(delta_inf,delta_aff,M_inf)=(7,3,16)`; explicitly attained by three nodes; missing noncoprime fixed-tuple routing. |
