+For the displayed witness, all relations check by hand. With
+
+```text
+rho=(123), alpha=(12), beta=(23), v=(12)(34),
+T=((12),(23),(13),(34),(12),(23)),
+```
+
+right-to-left multiplication gives
+
+```text
+Pi_1=Pi_3=(123),  Pi_2=(134)=rho v,
+Pi=(13)(24)=rho^-1 v rho,
+w=(234),  w'=(124),  G=w'w=(123).
